msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Isn't that Noto?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ese no es Noto?」"

msgid "Noto「AAAAAAAAAHHH!!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡¡AAAAAAAAAHHH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「EEEGH!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡AAAGH!!」"

msgid "Ami「That gave me a heart attack～」"
msgstr "Ami「Casi me da un infarto～」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you screaming for, stupid＿four-eyes?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué gritas, estúpido cuatro ojos?!」"

msgid "Noto「Ahh, it's just you～ Don't scare me like＿that.」"
msgstr "Noto「Ahh, solo son ustedes～ No＿me den esos sustos.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's my line!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Eso debería decirlo yo!!」"

msgid "Everyone「What?」"
msgstr "Todos「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Umm, I haven't heard anything about＿Kanou Sumire dying......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm, no he oído nada de que Kanou＿Sumire haya muerto......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah...... No kidding.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí...... Ni que lo digas.」"

msgid "Ami「Noto-kun, like, what are you talking＿about? Sounds fun, so let Ami-chan in＿on it～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Noto-kun, o sea, ¿de qué hablas?＿Suena divertido, así que deja＿que Ami-chan participe～①」"

msgid "Noto「What, for reals? You want to search＿with me, Ami-chan? You getting my＿hopes up?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Qué, en serio? ¿Quieres buscar conmigo,＿Ami-chan? ¿Me estás ilusionando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Search\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Buscar\"?」"

msgid "Ami「What a load of garbage.」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué sarta de tonterías.」"

msgid "Noto「Hmm? Did you say something?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Mmm? ¿Dijiste algo?」"

msgid "Ami「No no, nothiiing①」"
msgstr "Ami「No, no, nadaaa①」"

msgid "Taiga「Ridiculous.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ridículo.」"

msgid "Noto「Hmm? Did you say something?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Mmm? ¿Dijiste algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't mind her. Please continue.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No le hagas caso. Por favor, continúa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I see. Well, do your best.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ya veo. Bueno, haz lo que puedas.」"

msgid "Noto「Wha-huhhh? You're leaving,＿Takasu-kun? Can't we catch it＿together? What about Ami-chan～?」"
msgstr "Noto「¡¿Qu-Quéee?! ¿Te vas, Takasu-kun?＿¿No podemos atraparlo juntos? ¿Y＿qué hay de Ami-chan～?」"

msgid "Ami「Well, it's not like we were expecting＿anything useful, I guess～」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, tampoco es que esperáramos＿nada útil, supongo～」"

msgid "Taiga「That was so beyond pointless that it＿surpassed my worst imaginings.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso fue tan inútil que superó＿mis peores expectativas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I'm out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, me voy.」"

msgid "Noto「Ah, wait up, Takasu!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Ah, espera, Takasu!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not interested in doppelgangers or＿ghosts.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me interesan los doppelgangers＿ni los fantasmas.」"

msgid "Noto「No, that's not it, man. Do ya think＿Kitamura knows about the rumors of＿Kanou Sumire's ghost?」"
msgstr "Noto「No, no es eso. ¿Crees que Kitamura＿sepa de los rumores del fantasma＿de Kanou Sumire?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「M-Maybe......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿T-Tal vez......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why him and Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué él y Taiga?」"

msgid "Noto「\"Why\"......? Ohhh, that's right.」"
msgstr "Noto「¿\"Por qué\"......? Ohhh, es cierto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Noto「Sorry, it's nothing. Forget it, man.」"
msgstr "Noto「Perdón, no es nada. Olvídalo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That ain't gonna work on me. Did you＿think I'd say \"oh okay\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no va a funcionar conmigo. ¿Creíste＿que diría \"ah, está bien\"?」"

msgid "Noto「Welp, it's ghost hunting time! You can＿expect some good news later!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡En fin, es hora de cazar fantasmas!＿¡Espera buenas noticias más tarde!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（How exactly would Taiga and Kitamura＿look good together? How......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Cómo es que Taiga y Kitamura harían＿buena pareja? ¿Cómo......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（............）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（............）」"

msgid "Noto「It's just, you called my name all of a＿sudden, I nearly shit my pants.＿Thought you were the ghost of Kanou」"
msgstr "Noto「Es que me llamaste tan de repente＿que casi me cago del susto. Creí＿que eras el fantasma de Kanou」"

msgid "Noto「Sumire.」"
msgstr "Noto「Sumire.」"

msgid "Noto「The past few days, people have been＿seeing a Kanou Sumire lookalike here＿and there, man～ But she's in America,」"
msgstr "Noto「Estos últimos días se ha visto a alguien＿idéntica a Kanou Sumire por ahí～ Pero＿ella está en Estados Unidos,」"

msgid "Noto「right? Even the folks at Kanou-Mart＿say she hasn't been back.」"
msgstr "Noto「¿no? Hasta la gente del Kanou-Mart＿dice que no ha vuelto.」"

msgid "Noto「All over the Oohashi High School＿fansite people are spreading shit like＿\"Is it a doppelganger!? Is it a ghost!?\"」"
msgstr "Noto「En el sitio de fans de la Preparatoria＿Oohashi andan diciendo mierdas como＿\"¡¿Un doppelganger?! ¡¿Un fantasma?!\"」"

msgid "Noto「Did you know?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Lo sabías?」"

msgid "Noto「So after that, people on the site＿started to get worked up about finding＿the doppelganger or ghost or」"
msgstr "Noto「Y después de eso, en el sitio＿se alborotaron por encontrar al＿doppelganger, fantasma o」"

msgid "Noto「whatever.」"
msgstr "Noto「lo que sea.」"

msgid "Noto「Witnesses claim to have seen her＿around Kanou-Mart, but if you ask me,＿her ghost is WAY more likely to show」"
msgstr "Noto「Hay testigos que dicen haberla visto por＿el Kanou-Mart, pero si me preguntas, es＿MUCHO más probable que su fantasma」"

msgid "Noto「up around the school.」"
msgstr "Noto「aparezca por la escuela.」"

msgid "Noto「She was pretty passionate about＿student council, and then THAT＿happened just before she left for」"
msgstr "Noto「Le apasionaba bastante el consejo＿estudiantil, y justo pasó ESO＿antes de que se fuera a」"

msgid "Noto「America, right? With all that drama, I'm＿sure THIS is where it'll manifest!」"
msgstr "Noto「Estados Unidos, ¿no? Con todo ese drama,＿¡seguro que AQUÍ se manifiesta!」"

msgid "Noto「Man, I'm psyched! When I catch it, I'll＿become a legend! Rather than try to＿get a girlfriend, I've decided to strive」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Qué emoción! ¡Cuando lo atrape, me＿volveré una leyenda! En vez de intentar＿conseguir novia, decidí aspirar」"

msgid "Noto「for godhood!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡a la divinidad!」"

msgid "Noto「Does he still have feelings for her, I＿wonder? Don't you think Kitamura＿would be better off hooking up with」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Seguirá sintiendo algo por ella?＿¿No crees que a Kitamura le iría＿mejor saliendo con」"

msgid "Noto「Tiger over her?」"
msgstr "Noto「Tigre en vez de ella?」"

msgid "Noto「Naw, I was just sayin' I think Kitamura＿and the Tiger would look good＿together, man～ But I'm no gossip. You」"
msgstr "Noto「Nah, solo decía que Kitamura y＿la Tigre harían buena pareja～ Pero＿no soy chismoso. Puedes」"

msgid "Noto「can ask Tiger for the details.」"
msgstr "Noto「preguntarle los detalles a Tigre.」"
